mods/my-spaces, mods/my-tabs and mods/my-agents are modified copies of the
`spaces`, `tabs` and `agents` mods that ship with Herdr (herdr-app 0.1.13,
https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). Each one's mod.json
records `cloned_from`. Changes from the originals:

- my-spaces: shows each space's select shortcut (for example ^1) at the end of
  its row, read from the key bindings.
- my-tabs: adds a "Git Log" panel button beside Files and Changes.
- my-agents: shows the shortcut of each agent's space (for example ^1) beside
  its row, read from the key bindings.

layouts/my-main.json is a modified copy of Herdr's `main` layout under the same
license. Everything else in this folder (git-log, usage, ask-herdr, the
tokyo-night theme, keys.json) is original to this repository and covered by its
MIT license.
